{"title":"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 27","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the adjoining figure triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> is inscribed in a circle. Point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> lies on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/5/e75dfafda89fb56a90305d4a24837e6a89b8f8db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\stackrel{\\frown}{AC}$\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/b/07bccdf864c3da8d74ac8353c331df4ce6106eb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\stackrel{\\frown}{DC} = 30^\\circ$\" width=\"73\" height=\"20\" />, and point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/2/6e28ce12d49d39f160d5a0ef54077fc98e4b9d2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$G$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> lies on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/4/fe488fc8419fcd2123d1d92ab09f3caf7cf7856a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\stackrel{\\frown}{BA}$\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/5/3c5b3fc4f33479e8688d8e4aa0d226def0b828f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\stackrel{\\frown}{BG}\\, &gt; \\, \\stackrel{\\frown}{GA}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"77\" height=\"21\" />. Side <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> and side <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> each have length equal to the length of chord <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/f/eaf9409044fef7f3966027eec40b2cced52eb16c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DG$\" width=\"29\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/8/b5817582e9b8092ba561ecf7d820a6d247c4cc3c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle CAB = 30^\\circ$\" width=\"103\" height=\"13\" />. Chord <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/f/eaf9409044fef7f3966027eec40b2cced52eb16c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DG$\" width=\"29\" height=\"12\" /> intersects sides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, respectively. The ratio of the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/f/e8f2628c7bd8aba6794daadad02ce8f46d94c15c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle AFE$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" /> to the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/8/2b826c3c9e9b8ac944aa21f15bb5d94f14e1e54c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy]  defaultpen(linewidth(.8pt)); pair C = origin; pair A = 2.5*dir(75); pair B = A + 2.5*dir(-75); path circ =circumcircle(A,B,C); pair D = waypoint(circ,(7/12)); pair G = waypoint(circ,(1/6)); pair E = intersectionpoint(D--G,A--C); pair F = intersectionpoint(A--B,D--G); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,A,N); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,B,SE); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,C,SW); label(&quot;$D$&quot;,D,SW); label(&quot;$G$&quot;,G,NE); label(&quot;$E$&quot;,E,NW); label(&quot;$F$&quot;,F,W); label(&quot;$30^\\circ$&quot;,A,12S+E,fontsize(6pt)); draw(A--B--C--cycle); draw(circ); draw(Arc(A,0.25,-75,-105)); draw(D--G); [/asy]\" width=\"648\" height=\"668\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/e/f3e0f997d4c9db1fccc1c90f6145517065aecbeb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\dfrac {2 - \\sqrt {3}}{3}\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\dfrac {2\\sqrt {3} - 3}{3}\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 7\\sqrt {3}-12\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 3\\sqrt {3}-5\\qquad\\\\ \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\dfrac {9-5\\sqrt {3}}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"503\" height=\"83\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> is isosceles, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/c/36c137312dfa6cf1e72473e0d04bcb8167a6df14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ACB = \\angle ABC = \\frac{150^{\\circ}}{2} = 75^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"250\" height=\"39\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/1/40113a02a204906822dc37790602e0eaac7ccc44.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\stackrel{\\frown}{AC}\\ =\\ \\stackrel{\\frown}{AB}\\ = 2 \\cdot 75^{\\circ} = 150^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"215\" height=\"24\" />.  Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/b/d8bab3280c6c6e4e1564cf0fa47dc69c4327057c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\stackrel{\\frown}{AD}\\ = 150^{\\circ} - 30^{\\circ} = 120^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"198\" height=\"25\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/0/3f061bde9bc5ff9779befa6a993cc2551fc71ef4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle AGD = \\angle ACD = \\frac{120^{\\circ}}{2} = 60^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"252\" height=\"39\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/b/95b1e99219c13aee8d13f9bc22c9a91717b5addf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DG = AB = AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"136\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/8/a886a78149ae5e1afbec659657afd62d165f835d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\stackrel{\\frown}{DG}\\ = 150^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"91\" height=\"24\" />.  So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/e/ebea12dcfe84c3593969ccbb547fb8ec0eda9139.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\stackrel{\\frown}{AG}\\ = 150^{\\circ} - 120^{\\circ} = 30^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"197\" height=\"25\" />.  Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/3/c6346a8c7ee26b8684e9b71fc36ce679fed36ed1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle AEG = \\angle DEC = \\frac{30^{\\circ} + 30^{\\circ}}{2} = 30^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"291\" height=\"39\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/f/e8f2628c7bd8aba6794daadad02ce8f46d94c15c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle AFE$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" /> is isosceles with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/7/b17b040c711628a32f501ca391e8859b7e71b0b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AF = FE$\" width=\"80\" height=\"13\" />.  Also <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/2/9e2c3ed18cdf0dbeddb0c356981efdba2b69993b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle AFE = 180^\\circ - 2 \\cdot 30^\\circ = 120^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"246\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/a/89a9ca05bc65d9d8e886c43bdf3d6070621b5574.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle AFG = 60^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"107\" height=\"15\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/4/9e4cae83c0fa7a0b33f58a5ec88e27c870c017a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle AFG$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" /> is equilateral.\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/0/2d0b60fd50ab00e04ce490428322813c25b42968.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = AF = FE = FG$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"170\" height=\"14\" />.  By the Law of Cosines, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/7/7d7dc2b7e09664df3da3f36a2573a96b99c0c71a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AE^2 = x^2 + x^2 - 2x \\cdot x \\cdot \\cos(120^\\circ) = 3x^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"322\" height=\"21\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/7/2b73a3605d4be55ad02bb8f0f0fa86dd0603d5e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AE = x\\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"89\" height=\"21\" />.  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/3/623ab095cdd6945b7acc8c71ecf729683a503fd0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\stackrel{\\frown}{AG}\\ =\\ \\stackrel{\\frown}{DC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"85\" height=\"24\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/1/cf1827f2c8ea086a7d49bc27d07f63ead67e8844.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AG = DC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"84\" height=\"14\" />.  Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/b/45b0c7ec55c880d64ac4a1d9bf6f2bd262cb3732.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle DEC \\cong \\triangle AEG$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"145\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/e/afee577bf88f5cb4be116089427d5223af460ae1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EC = 2x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"74\" height=\"14\" />.  Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/7/617f860549e04d6870e06f772b4d212784048376.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC = AB = x(2+\\sqrt{3})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"187\" height=\"24\" />.  The area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/f/e8f2628c7bd8aba6794daadad02ce8f46d94c15c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle AFE$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/7/f473d58283a2539c5d8a8f20e9cd0a51499ae6d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2} \\cdot x \\cdot x\\sqrt{3} \\cdot \\sin 30^\\circ = \\frac{x^2\\sqrt{3}}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"221\" height=\"43\" />, while the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/4/9b4026789f7676c9c1eeede4b2885ed0e283b547.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2} \\cdot x(2+\\sqrt{3}) \\cdot x(2+\\sqrt{3}) \\cdot \\sin 30^\\circ = \\frac{x^2(7+4\\sqrt{3})}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"390\" height=\"43\" />.  \n</p><p>The ratio of these two areas is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad2a6f89b43392460d5fb0d7c2266db3cfdba3ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\frac{x^2\\sqrt{3}}{4}}{\\frac{x^2(7+4\\sqrt{3})}{4}} = \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{7+4\\sqrt{3}} = \\sqrt{3}(7-4\\sqrt{3}) = 7\\sqrt{3} - 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -24px\" width=\"393\" height=\"57\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/4/dd4003a21b78c8ecdf40aef519713be4d9daa7eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{(D)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"37\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>-j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME\" title=\"1981 AHSME\">1981 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1981 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1981\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">Problem 26</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">Problem 28</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017173546\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.035 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.049 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 302/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2159/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 152/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 9974/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.171      1 Template:AHSME_box\n100.00%    7.171      1 -total\n-->